# `reporting/papers/` — Manuscripts

## Authority

See the root [`README.md`](../../README.md), reporting
[`README.md`](../README.md), and [`AGENTS.md`](../AGENTS.md).

Use one folder per manuscript, conventionally `YYYY-short-slug/`:

```
YYYY-short-slug/
├── manuscript.tex          # or another declared source format
└── deliveries/             # immutable dated submission/revision/published states
```

Draft source evolves on ordinary branches and is human-approved. Reference light
data figures from `results/figures/light/` and authored schematics from
`assets/figures/`. Build LaTeX source with shared `../_assets/lab.cls` and
`../_assets/refs.bib` where applicable.

At submission, revision, or publication, create a universal delivery containing
the exact PDF and exact figure bytes plus `delivery.yaml`; see
[`../DELIVERIES.md`](../DELIVERIES.md). Do not edit a delivery in place.
Existing `submissions/` folders from older versions are valid frozen history and
must remain where they are.
